# 複製此檔為 .env 後填入，.env 內含機密，不要分享、不要上傳
# Copy this file to .env and fill it in. .env holds secrets: never share it, never upload it.
# 格式 / format: KEY=value, one per line; lines starting with # are comments.

# ---- 機器人 Token / Bot token ----
# 到 https://discord.com/developers/applications 建立應用程式 -> Bot -> Reset Token
# Create an application at https://discord.com/developers/applications -> Bot -> Reset Token
DISCORD_TOKEN=貼上你的機器人Token

# 分身（選填）：想在"同一個伺服器的多個語音頻道同時播放"時，每個分身要有自己的機器人帳號
# 每個分身填一個 Token（DISCORD_TOKEN_2、DISCORD_TOKEN_3 …，沒有數量上限）
# 撐不住時，卡頓偵測器會確定原因後，從最後加入的頻道開始逐個停止並公告，詳見 README"分身"
# Clones (optional): to play in several voice channels of the SAME server at once, every clone needs its own
# bot account. Add one token per clone (DISCORD_TOKEN_2, DISCORD_TOKEN_3 ... no upper limit).
# If the machine can't keep up, the stutter detector confirms the cause and then stops channels one by one,
# newest first, with an announcement. See the README section on clones.
# DISCORD_TOKEN_2=
# DISCORD_TOKEN_3=

# 選填：你的伺服器 ID（開發者模式 -> 右鍵伺服器 -> 複製伺服器 ID），填了斜線指令會立即生效
# Optional: your server (guild) id (Developer Mode -> right-click the server -> Copy Server ID).
# With it set, slash commands appear immediately instead of after Discord's global sync delay.
GUILD_ID=

# ---- 網頁看板 / Web dashboard ----
# 讓朋友（不在你這台電腦上的人）也能開看板，詳見 README"讓朋友一起用"
# Let friends (people not on your computer) open the dashboard too; see the README section on sharing.
# DASHBOARD_PORT=8765
# DASHBOARD_HOST=127.0.0.1        # 區網／虛擬網路（Radmin、Tailscale、ZeroTier…）分享：改成 0.0.0.0 / to share over LAN or a virtual network (Radmin, Tailscale, ZeroTier...) set 0.0.0.0
#                                 #   改成 0.0.0.0 時，啟動會自動偵測並列出朋友可用的網址 / with 0.0.0.0 the start-up log lists the URLs friends can use
# DASHBOARD_URL=                  # 想手動指定 /help 給出的網址前綴時才填，例如 http://26.12.34.56:8765 / only to force the URL prefix that /help hands out, e.g. http://26.12.34.56:8765
#                                 #   或通道服務的 https://xxxx.trycloudflare.com / or a tunnel service address such as https://xxxx.trycloudflare.com

# ---- 中繼站（控制台節點）/ Relay (dashboard node) ----
# 想把"看板"放在 VPS／樹莓派上、"放歌"留在家裡時使用，詳見 README"中繼站"
# Use this to host the dashboard on a VPS / Raspberry Pi while the music keeps playing at home. See the README section on the relay.
# 家裡的機器人這一端要設定這兩個（主動連出去，不需要在家裡開任何埠）：
# The bot at home needs these two (it dials out, so no home port needs opening):
# RELAY_URL=ws://你的VPS位址:8765        # 有 TLS 時用 wss:// / use wss:// when you have TLS (replace the host with your VPS address)
# RELAY_KEY=                              # 至少 16 字元的隨機字串，兩邊必須一致 / a random string of at least 16 characters; both sides must match
# 中繼站（VPS／樹莓派）那一端的 .env 只需要：
# The .env on the relay side (VPS / Raspberry Pi) only needs:
# RELAY_KEY=（同上 / same as above）
# RELAY_PORT=8765
# RELAY_HOST=0.0.0.0
# 產生金鑰 / generate a key:  python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"

# 看板存取模式 / Dashboard access mode:
#   open（預設）  知道網址的人都能控制所有頻道，不需要任何驗證，只在你信任的網路使用
#                 default: anyone who knows the URL controls every channel, no verification. Only for networks you trust.
#   verify        要先用 Discord 確認身分：在 Discord 輸入 /help，點它給你的專屬連結（點一下就好，免輸入任何碼）
#                 驗證後顯示真實的 Discord 暱稱、可控制所有頻道，主機會記住他們的裝置，放到公開網路時建議用這個
#                 confirm identity through Discord first: type /help and open the personal link (one click, nothing to type).
#                 Afterwards the real Discord nickname is shown, all channels can be controlled and the host remembers the device.
#                 Recommended when the dashboard is exposed to the public internet.
#   voice         每人用 /help 的專屬連結，而且人要在語音頻道裡才能控制
#                 everyone uses their own /help link AND must be in a voice channel to control playback.
# 任何模式下，更換 Bilibili 帳號都只限機器人擁有者／本地
# In every mode, switching the Bilibili account is limited to the bot owner / the local machine.
# DASHBOARD_ACCESS=open

# ---- 音質 / Audio quality ----
# Opus 位元率（kbps），預設 192，也可在看板右上角或用 /quality 切換（會存起來，優先於這裡）
# Opus bitrate in kbps, default 192. It can also be switched on the dashboard (top right) or with /quality
# (the choice is saved and takes priority over this value).
# AUDIO_BITRATE=192

# ---- 閒置自動離開（秒；0 = 不自動離開）/ Idle auto-leave (seconds; 0 = never leave) ----
# 讓分身可以被別的頻道接手 / Lets a clone be taken over by another channel.
# MAX_QUEUE=5000              # 一個伺服器的待播清單最多幾首 / max songs in one server's queue
# TUNE_PROCESS=1              # Windows：優先權調高一級、關掉省電降速，設 0 關閉 / Windows: raise priority one step, no power throttling, 0 = off
# EMPTY_LEAVE_SECONDS=120     # 頻道內只剩機器人 / only bots left in the channel
# IDLE_LEAVE_SECONDS=300      # 沒有在播也沒有待播 / nothing playing and nothing queued

# ---- 其他 / Other ----
# VOICE_DEBUG=1               # 排查"沒聲音"：寫出 logs/voice-debug.log（權杖與金鑰自動遮蔽）/ debug "no sound": writes logs/voice-debug.log (tokens and keys are masked automatically)
# FFMPEG_PATH=C:\tools\ffmpeg\bin\ffmpeg.exe   # ffmpeg 不在 PATH 時才需要 / only needed when ffmpeg is not on PATH
